WEBVTT

00:12:29.263 --> 00:12:31.730
You said for some companies,

00:12:31.763 --> 00:12:35.530
sort of a blockbuster drug
is a one-billion-dollar treatment,

00:12:35.563 --> 00:12:39.797
but that for you, a blockbuster is
it reaches one billion people.

00:12:39.830 --> 00:12:41.797
Can you talk about that a little bit?

00:12:42.863 --> 00:12:44.030
KMS: Yeah, you know,

00:12:44.063 --> 00:12:48.663
I've always felt that the Western model,

00:12:48.697 --> 00:12:52.097
in terms of the pharmaceutical industry,

00:12:52.130 --> 00:12:56.730
has always been to serve
a small population

00:12:56.763 --> 00:13:00.930
which is affluent and which can pay
a lot for the drug.